   "html": "<div layer-name=\"Page\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;padding:32px;flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;min-height:0\">\n  <div layer-name=\"Artboard Header\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--spacing-xs)\">\n    <div layer-name=\"Artboard Title\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:22px;font-weight:var(--font-weight-semibold);line-height:28px;color:var(--color-canvas-label-title);white-space:nowrap\">App map</div>\n    <div layer-name=\"Job\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-body);font-weight:var(--font-weight-regular);line-height:var(--leading-body);color:var(--color-canvas-label-title);max-width:900px\">Where every surface is reached from. Left to right: a sidebar section (a detail root), then what it opens. Each section keeps its own navigation stack, so switching sections keeps your place.</div>\n  </div>\n  <div layer-name=\"Map\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px\">\n    <div layer-name=\"Map Row / All Trips\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center\">\n      <div layer-name=\"Node / All Trips\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;padding:10px 12px;flex-shrink:0;width:200px;background:var(--color-canvas-specimen-background);border-radius:var(--radius-card);border:2px solid var(--color-canvas-flow-arrow)\">\n        <div layer-name=\"Node Name\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-headline);font-weight:var(--font-weight-semibold);line-height:var(--leading-headline);color:var(--color-text-primary);white-space:nowrap\">All Trips</div>\n        <div layer-name=\"Node Kind\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-caption);font-weight:var(--font-weight-regular);line-height:var(--leading-caption);color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">Detail root · ⌘1, opens here</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
